{"product":{"id":6992577200282,"title":"POLYGON - Icons Pack","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eSynty® Studios\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e \u003c\/span\u003epresents: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePOLYGON - Icons Pack\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAn icons asset pack to add to your Polygon style game.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e◼ Key Features ◼\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e520 Polygon-style icons\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3D Icons, prototype and production ready\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEmojis (includes skin color alts)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustomisable solid color override materials\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e📦 Pack Content\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFood, Letters, Sports Gear, UI Elements, Emojis, Crafting Items, Network Symbols, Social Symbols, Stationery, Medical Items, Clothing, Weather, Computer Parts, Weapons, Awards, Backplates, and much more!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso includes skin color alts for emojis and Solid Color override materials\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e🤖 Technical Info\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e◼ Compatibility\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e◼\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCompatible with Unreal 4.26+\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eCompatible with Unity 2022.3+\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e- Supports URP and Built-in\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"Converting to the Universal Render Pipeline\" href=\"https:\/\/bit.ly\/synty-urp\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eView our tutorial\u003c\/a\u003e on converting to the Universal Render Pipeline (URP).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cme